question:
Your school library has decided to close two hours earlier on weekdays because of staffing costs. Many students use it after lessons.

Write a letter of about 200 words to the school principal, asking for the decision to be reconsidered. You should:
- state clearly what you are writing about and why;
- give two reasons, each supported with something concrete;
- propose one workable alternative;
- close appropriately.

Sign your letter "Chris Wong".

